					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2501.867,
							445.247,
							4636.573
						],
						"pointId": 4513
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2501.063,
							445.119,
							4637.081
						],
						"pointId": 5959
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740390501,
					"content": "薇蕾娜妲感谢你们能来帮忙！现在我们试试第一种药吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390502,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，不要喝太多呀！感觉不对就赶快吐出来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390503,
					"content": "好啦，我没事的，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390504,
					"content": "哼…我就是放不下心嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390505,
					"content": "我准备好了，把药剂给我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390506
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390506,
					"content": "这瓶叫做「超厉害药水」，理论上能让你变得超厉害！嗯…理论上啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "薇蕾娜妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 740390507,
					"content": "你从薇蕾娜妲手中接过药剂，一饮而尽。\\n尽管气味刺鼻难忍，但令人意外的是，药液口感清甜粘滞，并不难喝。\\n除此之外，你的身体再无其他反应。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740390508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740390508,
					"content": "然后，在薇蕾娜妲指示下，你们等到隙境原体活跃的时刻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
